  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">K2K follow-up programme DRC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Netherlands Enterprise Agency and the Netherlands Embassy in Kinshasa, Democratic Republic Congo (DRC), are supporting the development of a national entrepreneurship programme, applicable in multiple fields of studies and various geographical contexts in DRC and ensuring that it is accredited by national authorities. The establishment of this programme is aimed to support youth employment and entrepreneurship throughout the DRC.</narrative>
  </description>
